        rdfs:comment                   "Bequeathed to the V&A by Caroline Maria Slee, who died in 1947 at the age of 97.  Thy are part of a larger collection of 17th and 18th century accessories and baby linen.  According to famiily tradition, the coif and forehead cloth were worn on her great-great-great grandmother's wedding night."@en ;
